      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "German turns out to be a former boxing champion and easily floors all three chefs, but when a policeman walks into the alley, Barinov and German team up with a quick cover story.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "german",
      "t": "Ну что, по-мужски разобрались?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
